      "content": "<a class=\"tgme_widget_message_reply user-color-default\" href=\"/posts/17\" \"=\"\"><blockquote><small><i class=\"tgme_widget_message_reply_thumb\" style=\"background-image:url('/static/089f8c2e471736a0d0f06af2c8fdb97d.jpg')\"></i>\n<div class=\"tgme_widget_message_author accent_color\">\n  <span class=\"tgme_widget_message_author_name\" dir=\"auto\">投机之路</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tgme_widget_message_text js-message_reply_text\" dir=\"auto\">有一些交易所的internal trading desk会偷偷的跟单我这种超高胜率账户（同时也有做市商在运行“尝试跟单知情者”的探测orderbook和order flow的策略），刚刚在BR上测试了一下，用2%滑点买入，我把价格驱动上涨了11%</div>\n</small></blockquote></a><div class=\"image-list-container image-list-odd\">\n      <button class=\"image-preview-button image-preview-wrap\" popovertarget=\"modal-18-0\" popovertargetaction=\"show\">\n        <img src=\"/static/3cea09c031582911789734acefadfbf7.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"image-preview-button modal\" id=\"modal-18-0\" popovertarget=\"modal-18-0\" popovertargetaction=\"hide\" popover>\n        <img class=\"modal-img\" src=\"/static/3cea09c031582911789734acefadfbf7.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      </button>\n    </div>",
